        "innocentReading": "The Bank's DPF instrument rewards completed government actions. In an emergency (2020) the Bank picked prior actions from GoI's announced COVID package. In programmatic series (2023) it co-designs reforms through analytical work and TA, then counts them as prior actions. Neither pattern shows capture in either direction.",
